			"notes": "- Block drop direction now counter per position and has a determined sequence\n- Ender eye drop direction now relative to throw direction so it feels consistent regardless of which way the eye flew\n- Internal cleanup: switched all standardized RNG to plain new Random(seed) matching vanilla's distribution (projectiles, ender eye, block drops, explosions)\n- Removed UUID stamping on player projectiles and ender eye, replaced with internal state fields. Mob UUID stamping kept since it flows to client for sound variant\n- BlockDropRng renamed to BlockDropStandardization, ExplosionRng renamed to ExplosionStandardization"
		},
