			"notes": "### v1.6\n- Standardized goal AI, mainly for spawn mobs\n\n### v1.7\n- Standardized glowstone drops, per-block counter\n- Standardized crop drops (wheat, carrots, potatoes, beetroot, melon, pumpkin), per-block counter\n- Standardized ore drops (lapis, redstone, diamond, emerald, etc.), per-block counter\n- Debug nametags showing spawn slot info, gated on standardizeDebugNametags gamerule\n\n### v1.8\n- Deterministic player arrow firing per shot counter (bow)\n- Internal cleanup: merged throwables + arrow handling into one projectiles package\n- Note: Projectiles are seeded for their random throwing / shoot distribution not seeded to be completely strait\n\n### v1.9\n- Per-dimension projectile counters: each item (bow, snowball, pearl, etc.) tracks its own Nth-use counter per dimension\n- Crossbow firing standardized (was missed in 1.8 because crossbow bypasses setProperties)\n- Trident counter split from bow counter so they don't share an attempt sequence"
		},
